					{
						"analysis": "Package: markdown-it-py (whl)\nVersion: 3.0.0\nDescription: Python port of markdown-it. Markdown parsing, done right!\n\nThe source code represents the NVDA screen reader add-on 'AIHub' along with standard bundled Python libraries (Pillow, markdown-it-py, mdurl). The add-on provides AI assistance features for visually impaired users by integrating NVDA with various LLM, TTS, STT, and OCR APIs (such as OpenAI, Anthropic, Mistral, Google, xAI, and Ollama). All network requests go to configured API endpoints, audio recording uses standard Windows APIs (WinMM), and no malicious secret exfiltration, unauthorized binary execution, or payload downloading logic is present.",
